[{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0002","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0002.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56141","title":"Minosoft Minosoft AES加密初始化向量复用漏洞","description":"Minosoft（一款开源的 Kotlin 编写的多版本 Minecraft Java Edition 客户端）中 CryptManager.kt 加密例程在初始化 AES 密码时，将初始化向量（IV）直接设置为与密钥相同的值，而非使用随机数。由于 IV 缺乏随机性且从密钥直接派生，该加密机制易受选择密文/选择明文攻击：能够提交特定消息进行加密的攻击者可恢复出密钥。该漏洞影响所有支持 Minecraft 协议 1.7 及更高版本的 Minosoft 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0（中危），CWE-329。截至目前暂无补丁或有效缓解措施。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56141"],"sources":["cnnvd"],"published":"2026-07-07T00:16:33Z","updated":"2026-07-08T20:16:46Z","remediation":"修改 `CryptManager.kt` 中 `CryptManager` 加密例程，将初始化向量(IV)从直接复用密钥改为使用 `java.security.SecureRandom` 生成随机字节数组（如 `val iv = ByteArray(16); SecureRandom().nextBytes(iv)`），并调整编解码逻辑将 IV 与密文一同传输。在官方发布修复前，建议避免在不可信网络环境下使用加密功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/Bixilon/Minosoft/blob/3a608abe2d0999e4e702cc1b2d28366884c7f31e/src/main/java/de/bixilon/minosoft/protocol/protocol/encryption/CryptManager.kt#L72","https://github.com/Bixilon/Minosoft/security/advisories/GHSA-rvr6-48rj-c94j"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0002.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0487","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0487.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-14027","title":"Linux 内核 fremovexattr 文件引用泄露漏洞","description":"Linux 内核文件扩展属性处理模块（fs/xattr）存在文件描述符引用泄露漏洞。在 fremovexattr() 系统调用中，当 strncpy_from_user() 对 name 参数操作失败时，函数提前返回但未调用 fdput() 释放通过 fdget() 获取的文件引用。在多线程进程环境下，fdget() 走慢路径时该缺陷导致每次调用永久泄露一个文件引用，使得 struct file 及相关内核对象无法从内存中释放。本地非特权攻击者可反复触发该漏洞造成内核内存耗尽，影响系统稳定性。该漏洞已在提交 a71874379ec8（\"xattr: switch to CLASS(fd)\"）中修复，建议尽快升级内核版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-14027"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2026-03-09T16:16:14Z","updated":"2026-06-26T20:18:19Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至 6.6.133、6.12.77 或 6.13 及以上版本，该漏洞已在提交 a71874379ec8 中修复。如无法立即升级，可限制本地用户对 fremovexattr 系统调用的访问权限作为临时缓解措施，例如通过 seccomp 过滤或 LSM 模块拦截该调用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9a3a2ae5efbbcaed37551218abed94e23c537157","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a71874379ec8c6e788a61d71b3ad014a8d9a5c08","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d151b94967c8247005435b63fc60f8f4baa320da","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c2df87babf8eed88f612cb73e25ef1a25c924358/2024/CVE-2024-14027.json","https://github.com/xairy/linux-kernel-exploitation/blob/1120e9cea80c6039b8c8151bde6067c2cd76daa4/README.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/5cfa0f1bd26575870eeae4f5500f9044b4445f22/2024/CVE-2024-14027.json","https://github.com/microsoft/msft-linux-cve-analysis/blob/a841a405d027c9fb5457a22ca062dd95b1555c5d/vulns/CVE-2024-14027.yml_reasoning.md","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-14027","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-14027.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-14027.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2026/03/GHSA-h9jc-64qv-h9cg/GHSA-h9jc-64qv-h9cg.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5c4b2ba2a59a96457ab4b8ea4ee82efc5782bb1d/cves/2024/14xxx/CVE-2024-14027.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2024-14027","https://github.com/lcfr-eth/CVE-2024-14027_slop"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0487.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0533","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0533.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-47866","title":"Ceph RGW S3 对象复制空 HTTP 标头拒绝服务漏洞","description":"这是一个针对 Ceph 分布式存储平台在 S3 对象复制功能中的逻辑缺陷。攻击者可以通过向 RGW 守护程序发送包含空 HTTP 标头的 `PUT` 请求来触发漏洞， specifically when the `x-amz-copy-source` 参数的值为空字符串。多个 Ceph 版本（最先在 19.2.3 版本中发现）都受到该漏洞的影响，因为它们在处理空标头时没有进行充分验证，导致 R保持进程崩溃并引发拒绝服务攻击。该漏洞影响了广泛部署的分布式存储系统，可能导致云计算、对象存储和大数据应用等使用 Ceph 的服务不可用。该漏洞为远程无状态攻击，无需任何权限或用户交互即可触发，易于被攻击者利用。识别和缓解的当务之急是加强对 S3 请求参数的输入验证和边界检查，并尽快部署最新的安全补丁以应对该漏洞带来的服务可用性威胁。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-47866"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-12T19:15:34Z","updated":"2026-06-17T07:57:52Z","remediation":"立即升级 Ceph 至包含 commit `bef59f1` 的版本（≥19.2.3-0ubuntu1.25.10.3 或从 Ceph 主分支重新编译），该提交在 `RGWCopyObj::parse_copy_location()` 中增加了对空 `x-amz-copy-source` 头部的校验。Ubuntu 用户可通过 `apt update && apt upgrade ceph` 安装 USN-8045-1 提供的修复版本（25.10/24.04/22.04 已发布，20.04/18.04/16.04/14.04 需通过 Ubuntu Pro 获取）。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理或 WAF 层面拦截 `x-amz-copy-source` 值为空或仅含空白字符的 S3 PutObject 请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/ceph/ceph/security/advisories/GHSA-mgrm-g92q-f8h8","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/11/11/3","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2024/47xxx/CVE-2024-47866.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a538bd81432b918b342e413f43256da1f80b6c0d/2024/47xxx/CVE-2024-47866.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-47866","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/4cbc1cd445b97bc2235c2b80e223e324747c59b3/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-47866.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-47866.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f7fbdb78e572cf69166b06f5f222a65cac6edb53/references/CVE-2024-47866-2025-12-18-1005","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/0c43d6081c65becce3a5df5efcc5f04ee3e3a37d/community/ceph19/APKBUILD","https://github.com/univention/univention-corporate-server/blob/6de2a236d596f48d69a2ea791edef7f8811bfeea/doc/errata/published/2026-06-17_485_ceph.yaml","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/active/CVE-2024-47866","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-47866.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2024/POC-AVE-2024-0533.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2024/EXP-AVE-2024-0533.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0533.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0494","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0494.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-25621","title":"containerd CRI 目录本地权限提升漏洞","description":"containerd 容器运行时的 CRI 目录（`/var/lib/containerd`、`/run/containerd/io.containerd.grpc.v1.cri` 等）在创建时权限设置过宽（CWE-279），本地攻击者可利用该缺陷读取或修改容器运行时敏感文件，实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 containerd 0.1.0 至 1.7.28、2.0.0 至 2.0.6、2.1.0 至 2.1.4 及 2.2.0-beta.0 至 2.2.0-rc.1 版本，CVSS 评分 7.3，危害等级高。建议升级至 1.7.29、2.0.7、2.1.5 或 2.2.0 及以上版本修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.3,"aliases":["CVE-2024-25621"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-06T19:15:40Z","updated":"2026-06-17T07:16:18Z","remediation":"升级 containerd 至 v1.7.29、v2.0.7、v2.1.5 或 v2.2.0 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可手动执行 `chmod 755 /var/lib/containerd /run/containerd/io.containerd.grpc.v1.cri /run/containerd/io.containerd.sandbox.controller.v1.shim` 移除组/其他用户权限，或启用 rootless 模式运行 containerd 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/containerd/containerd/blob/main/docs/rootless.md","https://github.com/containerd/containerd/commit/7c59e8e9e970d38061a77b586b23655c352bfec5","https://github.com/containerd/containerd/security/advisories/GHSA-pwhc-rpq9-4c8w","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2024/25xxx/CVE-2024-25621.json","https://github.com/containerd/containerd/blob/55e47e129a4a5da45ce3d068103824653283ebf3/docs/security/THREAT_MODEL.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-25621","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-25621.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3e6800281dab3089a8374b9fe419c8b8110ea36/2024/25xxx/CVE-2024-25621.json","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/dabd751ebee99e2986a17e0dd685d32ee33f3524/specs/c/containerd/containerd.spec","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/go/github.com/containerd/containerd/CVE-2024-25621.yml","https://github.com/deckhouse/deckhouse/blob/09eff96b25139a5977ece704161e33b9768a7f37/CHANGELOG/CHANGELOG-v1.74.md","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/trusted-compute/blob/8b0ce9220dfa255c439d2c289b93cf7dc62e4b13/.trivyignore","https://github.com/arangodb/kube-arangodb/blob/1c431b137a3764d028c9430f437ded3aec268d92/CHANGELOG.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0494.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0496","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0496.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-31573","title":"XMLUnit for Java 默认配置XSLT扩展函数代码执行漏洞","description":"XMLUnit for Java 在 2.10.0 版本之前的默认配置中启用了 XSLT 扩展函数功能，当应用程序使用该库处理攻击者提供的不可信 XSLT 样式表时，攻击者可通过构造恶意的 XSLT 扩展函数调用，在 XML 转换过程中触发任意代码执行。该漏洞影响范围较广，利用条件较低，攻击者仅需诱导目标解析特制的 XSLT 文件即可实施攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.0,"aliases":["CVE-2024-31573"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-10-17T19:15:36Z","updated":"2026-06-17T07:28:35Z","remediation":"升级至 XMLUnit for Java 2.10.0 或更高版本，该版本已将 XSLT 扩展函数默认禁用。如无法立即升级，可手动配置 TransformerFactory 并设置 `javax.xml.transform.TransformerFactory` 系统属性为安全实现，或通过 `XMLUnit.setTransformerFactory()` 传入禁用扩展函数的 TransformerFactory 实例作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-chfm-68vv-pvw5","https://github.com/xmlunit/xmlunit/commit/b81d48b71dfd2868bdfc30a3e17ff973f32bc15b","https://github.com/xmlunit/xmlunit/issues/264","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-31573.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/362345baaa3b0376b2369a7901885756e250334b/cves/2024/31xxx/CVE-2024-31573.json","https://github.com/link-it/govway/blob/f01bfb4f0cf07a4cfba608c19cf0af9c99c352f1/resources/doc/src/manuali/vulnerability-management/securityAdvisory/2024/CVE-2024-31573.rst","https://github.com/ehcache/ehcache3/blob/a7f07f82e2c6b9aa04b79dfbda1fa2383aa68348/.cra/.cveignore","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-31573.json","https://github.com/livecvebench/CVE-Factory/blob/f5e32600fa4648ab7a86f33e230054e886ac93cc/cve_tasks/trainset-2/cve-2024-31573/Dockerfile","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3e6800281dab3089a8374b9fe419c8b8110ea36/2024/31xxx/CVE-2024-31573.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/b3554c3c2bf0f2c12989d1d265a8595d25100129/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-31573","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/maven/org.xmlunit/xmlunit-core/CVE-2024-31573.yml","https://github.com/xmlunit/xmlunit/blob/998399dba87d773c5f911c4c6a6c9cb1350a9216/RELEASE_NOTES.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0496.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0702","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0702.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-58241","title":"Linux 内核蓝牙 HCI 核心模块释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核蓝牙子系统的 HCI 核心模块存在工作队列未正确禁用漏洞。当调用 `hci_unregister_dev` 注销蓝牙 HCI 设备时，`hci_dev` 结构体即将被释放，但相关工作队列未通过 `disable_work_*` 机制正确禁用，导致新的工作项可能提交到已释放的内存区域，触发释放后使用（Use-After-Free）。本地攻击者需具备低权限（CAP_NET_ADMIN 或蓝牙相关权限），通过触发蓝牙设备热插拔或驱动卸载操作即可利用，导致系统可用性受影响（拒绝服务）。该漏洞影响 Linux 主线内核版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-58241"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-24T11:15:31Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:42Z","remediation":"立即应用 Linux 内核主线提交 cfdb13a54e05 或稳定分支提交 989fa5171f00 中的补丁，这两个补丁已在 hci_unregister_dev 中增加 disable_work_sync 调用以防止释放后使用。各发行版用户请安装包含该修复的内核更新包（如 Debian/Ubuntu 执行 apt update && apt upgrade linux-image，RHEL/CentOS 执行 yum update kernel），编译自建内核的用户需从 kernel.org 合入上述补丁后重新编译。如无法立即更新，可通过 rmmod bluetooth 卸载蓝牙模块或通过 blacklist btusb 禁用蓝牙驱动加载作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/989fa5171f005ecf63440057218d8aeb1795287d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cfdb13a54e05eb98d9940cb6d1a13e7f994d811f","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-58241.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58241.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-58241.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/13cb9776e1a75871fdb2907e6c4ccac1909e538b/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58241.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-58241","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/acf4fca32ae3e6d7d43276d798ba52a241ef3b49/2024/CVE-2024-58241.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/913667a73bdbecec80569e2765753066c820c678/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-58241.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-wxgw-p4p4-4xpp/GHSA-wxgw-p4p4-4xpp.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/01/08/seguranca/cve-2024-58241-bluetooth-hci-core-disable-works-on-1767883467000.md","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2024-58241"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0702.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0701","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0701.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-58240","title":"Linux Kernel TLS 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 TLS 子系统中存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞，由于非异步解密请求处理与异步解密请求处理未正确分离，在特定竞争条件下可导致已释放的内存被引用。本地低权限攻击者可通过精心构造的 TLS 解密请求触发该漏洞，成功利用可实现权限提升，获得完全的内存读写能力，进而控制系统。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核各发行版版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-58240"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-08-28T10:15:31Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:42Z","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至 6.1.149、6.6.21、6.7.9 或 6.8 及以上版本（对应各长期支持分支的修复版本）。Debian 用户请安装 DSA-6009-1 安全更新。如无法立即升级，可通过内核模块黑名单临时禁用 TLS 卸载功能（modprobe.blacklist=tls），但建议优先安排内核重启升级以彻底修复 Use-After-Free 漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/41532b785e9d79636b3815a64ddf6a096647d011","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/48905146d11dbf1ddbb2967319016a83976953f5","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/999115298017a675d8ddf61414fc7a85c89f1186","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/dec5b6e7b211e405d3bcb504562ab21aa7e5a64d","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/10/msg00008.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-032379.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-58240.md","https://github.com/google/security-research/blob/b204cbca92179ef0fefb879d952fe10312a67e22/pocs/linux/kernelctf/CVE-2024-58240_cos/metadata.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58240.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-58240.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-58240","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/acf4fca32ae3e6d7d43276d798ba52a241ef3b49/2024/CVE-2024-58240.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/913667a73bdbecec80569e2765753066c820c678/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-58240.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/31d5b78ee7ad856a6aee490403faecefdc8a4878/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-58240-2025-11-03-1121","https://github.com/xiawubing/vm-lab/blob/2d0e27bb078c8eee9151db20f17b8447538142a4/agent-container/cve-info/CVE-2024-58240_cos.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7418aa4f1c4590a239ce7ccd2c9efba72e268cc5/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-58240.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0701.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0486","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0486.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-13978","title":"LibTIFF tiff2pdf 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"LibTIFF 4.7.0及之前版本中的 fax2ps 组件存在空指针解引用漏洞。漏洞位于 tools/tiff2pdf.c 文件的 t2p_read_tiff_init 函数中，攻击者需本地向目标系统提交特制的 TIFF 文件触发该漏洞，导致程序崩溃拒绝服务。攻击复杂度较高，利用难度较大。官方已发布补丁修复此问题。","severity":"LOW","score":2.0,"aliases":["CVE-2024-13978"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-08-01T22:15:25Z","updated":"2026-06-17T07:03:05Z","remediation":"立即升级 LibTIFF 至 4.7.1 或更高版本，该版本已合入提交 2ebfffb0 的修复。如无法升级，可手动应用该补丁：在 tools/tiff2pdf.c 中增加对 TIFFTAG_TILELENGTH 和 TIFFTAG_TILEWIDTH 的合法性校验。临时缓解措施为避免使用 fax2ps 处理不可信的 TIFF 文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.libtiff.org/","https://gitlab.com/libtiff/libtiff/-/commit/2ebfffb0e8836bfb1cd7d85c059cd285c59761a4","https://gitlab.com/libtiff/libtiff/-/issues/649","https://gitlab.com/libtiff/libtiff/-/merge_requests/667","https://vuldb.com/?ctiid.318355","https://vuldb.com/?id.318355","https://vuldb.com/?submit.624562","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/09/msg00031.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-13978.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5c4b2ba2a59a96457ab4b8ea4ee82efc5782bb1d/cves/2024/13xxx/CVE-2024-13978.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-13978","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/dabd751ebee99e2986a17e0dd685d32ee33f3524/specs/l/libtiff/libtiff.spec","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-13978.json","https://github.com/grafana/grafana-image-renderer/blob/ec403bc693217e57eee3ea0e2b4d757823d664ff/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a5255477d5a184aa815a0febf0096e43251805cf/2024/13xxx/CVE-2024-13978.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-13978.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/54ab2d6e8edcc52192915a067c45b2190f568993/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-13978-2025-11-03-1251","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-13978.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0486.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0538","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0538.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-48916","title":"Ceph RadosGW 身份验证绕过漏洞","description":"Ceph 分布式存储系统的 RadosGW 组件在 JWT 认证实现中存在身份验证绕过漏洞。由于未正确校验 JWT 签名算法，攻击者可构造 alg 字段为 \"none\" 的恶意 JWT 令牌绕过签名验证，从而以任意用户身份访问 RadosGW 的 OIDC 提供者接口。该漏洞允许已获得低权限的远程攻击者利用特制请求提升权限，导致机密性和完整性失陷。影响 Ceph 19.2.3 及以下版本，CVSS 评分 8.1，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-48916"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-07-30T20:15:33Z","updated":"2026-06-17T07:59:01Z","remediation":"立即升级 Ceph Squid 至 v19.2.3 或更高版本（v19.2.3 已通过 PR#62137 修复此漏洞），升级命令：`cephadm upgrade --ceph-version 19.2.3`。如无法立即升级，在 RadosGW 配置中禁用 OIDC 身份提供商（`rgw sts key = ` 置空），或在反向代理层拦截含 `\"alg\":\"none\"` 的 JWT 令牌请求作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/ceph/ceph/security/advisories/GHSA-5g9m-mmp6-93mq","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-48916.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2024/48xxx/CVE-2024-48916.json","https://github.com/ceph/ceph/blob/3bfe0dfc62cf3f0d707da7a158af0ab9d4629fb5/doc/releases/squid.rst","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a538bd81432b918b342e413f43256da1f80b6c0d/2024/48xxx/CVE-2024-48916.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2024-48916","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/4cbc1cd445b97bc2235c2b80e223e324747c59b3/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-48916.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-48916.md","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2024-48916","https://github.com/drunkard/ceph-readable-doc/blob/af1d8e58a9378f99cc6b270c0f6bc341168cb9c6/html/releases/squid/index.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2024/CVE-2024-48916.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2024/POC-AVE-2024-0538.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0538.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0704","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0704.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-58266","title":"Rust shlex crate 命令注入漏洞","description":"Rust 的 shlex crate（<1.2.1）在处理命令行参数分割时，未正确转义未加引号的 `{` 字符和 `\\xa0`（不间断空格）字符，导致生成的 shell 命令字符串可能被注入额外参数。本地攻击者可通过构造包含恶意载荷的输入，在目标系统上执行非预期的命令操作。该漏洞影响所有使用 shlex crate 解析 shell 命令的 Rust 应用，CVSS 评分 3.2，危害等级低，利用条件较为苛刻（需本地访问且攻击复杂度高）。","severity":"LOW","score":3.2,"aliases":["CVE-2024-58266"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-07-27T22:15:25Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:44Z","remediation":"立即将 Rust 项目依赖中的 shlex crate 升级至 1.2.1 或更高版本（`cargo update -p shlex`），该版本已修复未引号包裹的 `{` 和 `\\xa0` 字符处理问题。如无法立即升级，在调用 shlex::split 或 shlex::try_split 前对所有输入进行严格的白名单过滤，禁止包含 `{` 和 `\\xa0` 字符的字符串传入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://crates.io/crates/shlex","https://github.com/comex/rust-shlex/security/advisories/GHSA-r7qv-8r2h-pg27","https://rustsec.org/advisories/RUSTSEC-2024-0006.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58266.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b7d9f3f65d1036a114c9bae4a66ed35d83999166/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-58266.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/cargo/shlex/CVE-2024-58266.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-58266","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/04aa8ca564639267b9d3e24749bc97bd87299d48/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58266.json","https://github.com/rustsec/advisory-db/blob/29638ff054fdbb83d2844240f7ef7e576cb52629/crates/shlex/RUSTSEC-2024-0006.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2024-58266.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2025/12/06/seguranca/cve-2024-58266-the-shlex-crate-before-121-for-rust-1765072016000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/github-reviewed/2025/07/GHSA-286m-6pg9-v42v/GHSA-286m-6pg9-v42v.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/active/CVE-2024-58266"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0704.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0529","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0529.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-47252","title":"Apache HTTP Server mod_ssl 日志变量转义漏洞","description":"Apache HTTP Server 2.4.63及更早版本中存在 mod_ssl 错误日志变量转义不足的漏洞。当使用 CustomLog 配置日志记录时，如果使用 \"%{varname}x\" 或 \"%{varname}c\" 格式来记录 mod_ssl 提供的变量（如 SSL_TLS_SNI），mod_log_config 和 mod_ssl 不会对来自客户端的变量进行任何转义处理。这允许不受信任的 SSL/TLS 客户端向日志文件中注入转义字符，可能破坏日志文件完整性甚至导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Windows 10/11、Windows Server 2019/2022 等版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级中危。Apache 已经在安全更新中修复了此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-47252"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-07-10T17:15:46Z","updated":"2026-06-17T07:56:47Z","remediation":"升级 Apache HTTP Server 至 2.4.64 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，在日志配置中避免使用 `%{varname}x` 和 `%{varname}c` 记录 mod_ssl 提供的变量（如 SSL_TLS_SNI），或改用 `%{escapemd}varname}x` 格式进行转义输出，防止恶意客户端注入转义字符到日志文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://httpd.apache.org/security/vulnerabilities_24.html","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/07/10/2","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/07/10/6","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/08/msg00009.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-47252.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2024/47xxx/CVE-2024-47252.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2024-47252","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/4cbc1cd445b97bc2235c2b80e223e324747c59b3/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-47252.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4a810b0db2e9cab67156f722c309e925ee8f02a0/2024/47xxx/CVE-2024-47252.json","https://github.com/apache/security-site/blob/1ec2440bfd8f47ff50026ffcb22c3a5db913e2af/static/projects/httpd/CVE-2024-47252.osv.json","https://github.com/RohitPatnaik/GenAi/blob/6d7779df77f42cd0a38d38536d95b88b8754441f/knowledgebase/CVE-2024-47252/CVE-2024-47252.py","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/0c43d6081c65becce3a5df5efcc5f04ee3e3a37d/main/apache2/APKBUILD","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/9c21390c1b52354f2bcded00c6f9b47d11852fe2/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-47252-2025-11-04-1536","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-47252.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2024/POC-AVE-2024-0529.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0529.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0510","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0510.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-43204","title":"Apache HTTP Server mod_headers 服务端请求伪造漏洞","description":"Apache HTTP Server 存在服务端请求伪造（SSRF）漏洞，当 mod_proxy 模块启用且 mod_headers 配置为允许用户可控值修改 Content-Type 请求或响应头时，远程攻击者可利用该配置缺陷发送出站代理请求至恶意 URL，从而访问内部网络资源或执行内网扫描。该漏洞影响 Apache HTTP Server 2.4.64 以下版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议升级至 2.4.64 版本修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-43204"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-07-10T17:15:45Z","updated":"2026-06-17T07:50:36Z","remediation":"立即升级 Apache HTTP Server 至 2.4.64 或更高版本，该版本已修复 mod_headers 与 mod_proxy 组合使用时的 SSRF 漏洞。如无法立即升级，可临时移除 mod_headers 中对 Content-Type 请求/响应头的动态修改配置，或在不影响业务的前提下禁用 mod_proxy 模块以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://httpd.apache.org/security/vulnerabilities_24.html","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/07/10/2","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/07/10/4","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/08/msg00009.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-43204.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86060d5336eceede57f01ccb65fb3037638af8db/cves/2024/43xxx/CVE-2024-43204.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2024-43204","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/c723932b6cef36d7df29b07fee2ccc4a2e5a8288/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-43204.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2726c8e981acc1c694a4bf2f24fcc9360825f783/2024/43xxx/CVE-2024-43204.json","https://github.com/RohitPatnaik/GenAi/blob/6d7779df77f42cd0a38d38536d95b88b8754441f/knowledgebase/CVE-2024-43204/CVE-2024-43204.py","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/72f2dfae7109a1c22fada87801e672e993ae2d77/main/apache2/APKBUILD","https://github.com/Andy-you/CVE-Reproducer-System/blob/eed6ce1aca8419ab3b1d0625e6cd0195c026abb0/debug/CVE-2024-43204/CVE-2024-43204-build_run.sh","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/891e02cb95ef463730509df70a6ab47638098a75/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-43204-2025-11-03-1306","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-43204.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2024/POC-AVE-2024-0510.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2024/EXP-AVE-2024-0510.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0510.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0501","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0501.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-36357","title":"AMD 处理器 L1 数据队列瞬态执行信息泄露漏洞","description":"AMD 处理器 L1 数据队列（L1D Cache）中存在瞬态执行漏洞，属于瞬态调度程序攻击（Transient Scheduler Attack）。本地攻击者可通过利用处理器预测执行过程中的时序差异，在特权边界外推断 L1D 缓存中的敏感数据内容，导致信息泄露。该漏洞影响多款 AMD 处理器产品，CVSS 评分 5.6，危害等级中等。建议用户及时更新 AMD 提供的微码补丁以缓解此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.6,"aliases":["CVE-2024-36357"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-07-08T17:15:31Z","updated":"2026-06-17T07:36:34Z","remediation":"建议更新 AMD 处理器微码（Microcode）至厂商提供的最新版本，可通过主板厂商提供的 BIOS/UEFI 固件更新安装。在 AMD 官方发布修复前，可启用操作系统级的内核页表隔离（KPTI）和分支预测清理（如 Linux 内核的 MITIGATION_L1D_FLUSH）缓解跨权限的 L1D 缓存侧信道泄露。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.amd.com/en/resources/product-security/bulletin/amd-sb-7029.html","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/08/28/2","http://xenbits.xen.org/xsa/advisory-471.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/10/msg00007.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/10/msg00008.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-36357.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9342e5394ee109ffc3617b5105797cdfcfcb78cf/cves/2024/36xxx/CVE-2024-36357.json","https://github.com/speed47/spectre-meltdown-checker/blob/c1aee44717db60937031b48eececb9c700cc096c/README.md","https://github.com/QubesOS/qubes-secpack/blob/b1af9882e6723a28e75c427f499d2ddcbffaec93/QSBs/qsb-108-2025.txt","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-36357","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3e6800281dab3089a8374b9fe419c8b8110ea36/2024/36xxx/CVE-2024-36357.json","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/72f2dfae7109a1c22fada87801e672e993ae2d77/main/xen/APKBUILD","https://github.com/microsoft/side-channel-fuzzer/blob/df67198bf0b6711fb9689b2cc9e97ebfc6379696/docs/index.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/891e02cb95ef463730509df70a6ab47638098a75/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-36357-2025-11-03-1121","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2025/07/GHSA-76p2-wq47-mf7x/GHSA-76p2-wq47-mf7x.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0501.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0500","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0500.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-36350","title":"AMD 处理器存储队列瞬态调度攻击信息泄露漏洞","description":"AMD 部分处理器存在瞬态执行漏洞，该漏洞源于存储队列（Store Queue）中的瞬态调度程序攻击。本地攻击者可通过利用处理器的瞬态执行机制，推断先前存储操作中的数据，从而导致敏感特权信息泄露。该漏洞影响多款 AMD 处理器产品，需本地访问权限方可利用，CVSS 评分 5.6，危害等级中危。建议用户及时更新 AMD 提供的微码补丁以缓解风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.6,"aliases":["CVE-2024-36350"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-07-08T17:15:31Z","updated":"2026-06-17T07:36:33Z","remediation":"立即联系设备 OEM 厂商获取并安装针对受影响 AMD 处理器（Zen 3/4 架构）的最新 BIOS/固件更新，例如 MilanPI 1.0.0.G、GenoaPI 1.0.0.E、ComboAM5PI 1.2.0.3 等对应版本，同时安装操作系统厂商提供的安全更新以启用 VERW 指令缓存清除机制。使用 Xen 虚拟化平台的用户须同步应用 XSA-471 补丁集，在虚拟机上下文切换时执行缓存 scrubbing 操作。如无法立即更新，可考虑限制本地非特权用户的交互式访问作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.amd.com/en/resources/product-security/bulletin/amd-sb-7029.html","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/08/28/2","http://xenbits.xen.org/xsa/advisory-471.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/10/msg00007.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/10/msg00008.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-36350.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9342e5394ee109ffc3617b5105797cdfcfcb78cf/cves/2024/36xxx/CVE-2024-36350.json","https://github.com/speed47/spectre-meltdown-checker/blob/c1aee44717db60937031b48eececb9c700cc096c/README.md","https://github.com/QubesOS/qubes-secpack/blob/b1af9882e6723a28e75c427f499d2ddcbffaec93/QSBs/qsb-108-2025.txt","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-36350","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3e6800281dab3089a8374b9fe419c8b8110ea36/2024/36xxx/CVE-2024-36350.json","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/72f2dfae7109a1c22fada87801e672e993ae2d77/main/xen/APKBUILD","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/891e02cb95ef463730509df70a6ab47638098a75/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-36350-2025-11-03-1320","https://github.com/microsoft/side-channel-fuzzer/blob/df67198bf0b6711fb9689b2cc9e97ebfc6379696/docs/index.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2025/07/GHSA-3q6p-m26m-f78r/GHSA-3q6p-m26m-f78r.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0500.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0493","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0493.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-25178","title":"LuaJIT 和 OpenRusty luajit2 栈溢出处理程序越界读取漏洞","description":"LuaJIT 及 OpenRusty luajit2 的栈溢出处理函数（lj_state.c）存在越界读取漏洞（CWE-125）。当 Lua 脚本触发栈溢出时，处理函数未能正确校验内存边界，可被攻击者利用构造特制脚本触发越界读取，导致敏感信息泄露。CVSS 评分 9.1，危害严重。影响 LuaJIT 2.1 及之前版本、OpenRusty luajit2 v2.1-20240314 之前版本。用户应升级至 luajit2 v2.1-20240314 或更高版本修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-25178"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-07-07T17:15:27Z","updated":"2026-06-17T07:15:39Z","remediation":"将 LuaJIT 升级至包含 commit defe61a56751 的版本（2024 年 3 月后快照）；使用 OpenResty 的用户将 luajit2 升级至 v2.1-20240314 或更高版本。Debian 用户可通过 `apt upgrade luajit` 安装 2025 年 8 月 LTS 安全更新。无法立即升级时，可在应用层限制不可信 Lua 脚本的加载执行作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://gist.github.com/pwnhacker0x18/423b4292f301ab274b42d5ed6e0b87d8","https://github.com/LuaJIT/LuaJIT/commit/defe61a56751a0db5f00ff3ab7b8f45436ba74c8","https://github.com/LuaJIT/LuaJIT/issues/1152","https://github.com/openresty/luajit2/commit/defe61a56751a0db5f00ff3ab7b8f45436ba74c8","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/08/msg00022.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a